    {
      "id": "legend-sign-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 35,
      "y": 542,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 36,
      "text": "π^{wb}_h < 0  means more water = lower cost (water has value, displaces thermal)\nβ^v_h < 0  so the cut  θ ≥ α + β^v · v  correctly penalizes low storage (future is more expensive with less water)\nIncoming state on RHS with coefficient +1  →  β = π directly (no sign flip, no transpose of constraint matrix needed)",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "baseline": 30,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 6010231,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },

