    {
      "id": "detail-intercept-formula",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1185,
      "y": 502,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 72,
      "text": "α_t = Q_t(x̂_{t-1}, ω_t)\n     − Σ_h β^v_{t,h} · v̂_h\n     − Σ_{h,l} β^{lag}_{t,h,l} · â_{h,l}\n\nEnsures cut is tight at the trial point:\nα + β^T · x̂ = Q_t(x̂, ω) exactly",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
